OL,3,GNEWSA'I had horrible thoughts after my
OL,4,Ababy was born': Dad's experience of
OL,5,Apostnatal depression
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains references
OL,8,Fto mental health struggles and negative
OL,9,Fthoughts that some readers may find
OL,10,Fdistressing
OL,12,FSteve Sharman was thrilled to become a
OL,13,Ffather.
OL,15,FBut in the days after his daughter was
OL,16,Fborn, he was struck by "awful and
OL,17,Freally, really horrible thoughts" about
OL,18,Fharming her.
